{'symbol': 'MTB', 'date': '2022-01-05 10:00:00', 'title': 'ERIC FELDSTEIN NAMED M&T BANK WESTERN NEW YORK REGIONAL PRESIDENT', 'text': "BUFFALO, N.Y., JAN. 5, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0ERIC FELDSTEIN HAS BEEN NAMED M&T BANK (NYSE: MTB) REGIONAL PRESIDENT OF WESTERN NEW YORK – THE COMPANY'S HEADQUARTER MARKET AND WHERE IT WAS FOUNDED 165 YEARS AGO – IN ADDITION TO HIS ROLE AS HEAD OF BUSINESS BANKING, BEGINNING IN MARCH OF 2022."}